  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WB Multi Partner Fund 2018-2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the multidonor fund is to provide a platform for coordinated financing for the sustainable reconstruction and development of Somalia, with a focus on core state functions and socio-economic recovery.</narrative>
  </description>
